flowchart TD
    A[User Request] --> B[Agent Orchestrator]
    B --> C[Plan Task]
    C --> D{Need External Context/Actions?}

    D -- No --> E[Reason + Generate Response]
    E --> F[Return to User]

    D -- Yes --> G[Select MCP Tool/Server]
    G --> H[Send MCP Request]
    H --> I[MCP Server]
    I --> J[Tool Execution<br/>(DB/API/File/Code/Search)]
    J --> K[Structured Result]
    K --> L[Agent Validates + Integrates Result]
    L --> M{More Tool Calls Needed?}

    M -- Yes --> G
    M -- No --> E

    E --> N[Log Trace + Memory Update]
    N --> F
